Package: nvfancontrol
Version: 1.0.1
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: 841973620 <admin@841973620.net>
Depends: bash, kmod, make, gcc, util-linux
Suggests: dkms
Description: DGX Spark persistent EC fan sysfs controller
 The module supports auto, max, and a common RPM floor from 1890 to 13500.
 The command-line interface accepts --speed RPM for a one-time request.
